# Compiled TypeScript output.
#
# build.sh deletes and regenerates this directory (`rm -rf out/` then `tsc -p ./`),
# and nothing in a checkout ever reads it: the extension is installed from the
# packaged .vsix, which carries its own copy of the compiled JS. The .vsix files
# themselves stay tracked - they ARE the distribution channel, and no downstream
# box has a build step to produce them.
out/
